{"data":[{"created_at":"2025-10-08T17:06:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1975971062778327284"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"huggingface.co/blog/bigcode/a…","end":71,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/blog/bigcode/arena","start":48,"status":200,"unwound_url":"https://huggingface.co/blog/bigcode/arena","url":"https://t.co/TMyYpHA3lM"},{"display_url":"huggingface.co/spaces/bigcode…","end":174,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/bigcode/arena","start":151,"status":200,"unwound_url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/bigcode/arena","url":"https://t.co/KPk8q0wB8G"},{"display_url":"drive.google.com/file/d/1gt5Ws0…","end":213,"expanded_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gt5Ws0FGVfg78jDGRBS4scY8IqMKRJyp/view?usp=sharing","start":190,"status":200,"unwound_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gt5Ws0FGVfg78jDGRBS4scY8IqMKRJyp/view?usp=sharing","url":"https://t.co/a9plXehamb"},{"display_url":"github.com/bigcode-projec…","end":248,"expanded_url":"https://github.com/bigcode-project/bigcodearena","start":225,"status":200,"unwound_url":"https://github.com/bigcode-project/bigcodearena","url":"https://t.co/tx7Ynz7j4N"}]},"id":"1975971062778327284","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":847,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1975971061293535552","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"- For more details, please check out the blog:  https://t.co/TMyYpHA3lM\n\n- Try recent LLMs (e.g., Qwen3 series and DeepSeek-V3.2) on BigCodeArena now: https://t.co/KPk8q0wB8G\n\n- Paper Link: https://t.co/a9plXehamb\n\n- GitHub: https://t.co/tx7Ynz7j4N"},{"created_at":"2025-10-08T17:06:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1975971061293535552"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":132,"id":"1642834485673619457","start":128,"username":"e2b"},{"end":164,"id":"1648404171090018307","start":148,"username":"hyperbolic_labs"},{"end":173,"id":"61559439","start":166,"username":"nvidia"},{"end":192,"id":"1753339277386342400","start":179,"username":"Alibaba_Qwen"}]},"id":"1975971061293535552","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1006,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1975971058323947955","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"BigCodeArena cannot be built without the support of the BigCode community. We are grateful for the huge credits provided by the @e2b team. We thank @hyperbolic_labs, @nvidia, and @Alibaba_Qwen for providing the model inference endpoints."},{"created_at":"2025-10-08T17:06:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1975971058323947955"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/prKor0NaCo","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BigCodeProject/status/1975971058323947955/photo/1","media_key":"3_1975631163189243904","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/prKor0NaCo"}]},"id":"1975971058323947955","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":397,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1975971055333528044","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"Beyond human votes, we release two new benchmarks:\n\n- BigCodeReward: tests reward models on 4.7K human preference votes. Execution feedback improves judgment accuracy.\n\n- AutoCodeArena: automated evaluation of 20+ LLMs. GPT-5 leads, followed by Claude-Opus-4 and Claude-Sonnet-4. https://t.co/prKor0NaCo"},{"created_at":"2025-10-08T17:06:26.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1975971055333528044"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/k7rRYbbbhS","end":287,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BigCodeProject/status/1975971055333528044/photo/1","media_key":"3_1975630915993735169","start":264,"url":"https://t.co/k7rRYbbbhS"}]},"id":"1975971055333528044","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":430,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1975971052732956754","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"In 5 months, BigCodeArena collected 14K conversations &amp; 4.7K preference votes across 10 frontier LLMs.\n\nFindings:\n1. o3-mini &amp; o1-mini consistently top Elo rankings\n2. Claude-3.5-Sonnet excels in matched-language settings\n3. Previous open models still lag https://t.co/k7rRYbbbhS"},{"created_at":"2025-10-08T17:06:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1975971052732956754"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/s2UuiAiWYO","end":282,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BigCodeProject/status/1975971052732956754/photo/1","media_key":"3_1975630722472747008","start":259,"url":"https://t.co/s2UuiAiWYO"}]},"id":"1975971052732956754","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":549,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1975971050589704358","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"Why does this matter?\n\nBenchmarks like HumanEval only scratch the surface. Reading code “by eye” is error-prone. True quality emerges when you actually run it: web apps render, games play, edge cases break.\n\nBigCodeArena makes execution feedback the default. https://t.co/s2UuiAiWYO"},{"created_at":"2025-10-08T17:06:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1975971050589704358"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/ymeK7BXuPy","end":298,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BigCodeProject/status/1975971050589704358/photo/1","media_key":"3_1975630619527774209","start":275,"url":"https://t.co/ymeK7BXuPy"}]},"id":"1975971050589704358","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":26,"impression_count":45127,"like_count":83,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":29},"text":"Introducing BigCodeArena, a human-in-the-loop platform for evaluating code through execution.\n\nUnlike current open evaluation platforms that collect human preferences on text, it enables interaction with runnable code to assess functionality and quality across any language. https://t.co/ymeK7BXuPy"},{"created_at":"2024-07-17T16:57:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1813618988246790452"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"huggingface.co/blog/terryyz/b…","end":239,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/blog/terryyz/bigcodebench-hard","start":216,"url":"https://t.co/zc4NuIvIDX"},{"display_url":"huggingface.co/spaces/bigcode…","end":276,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/bigcode/bigcodebench-leaderboard","start":253,"url":"https://t.co/zbTr3JPcCe"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/kCkYf3fcNf","end":300,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BigCodeProject/status/1813618988246790452/photo/1","media_key":"3_1813608381279539200","start":277,"url":"https://t.co/kCkYf3fcNf"}]},"id":"1813618988246790452","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":39,"impression_count":35658,"like_count":96,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":23},"text":"Releasing BigCodeBench-Hard: a subset of more challenging and user-facing tasks.\n\nBigCodeBench-Hard provides more accurate model performance evaluations and we also investigate some recent model updates.\n\nRead more: https://t.co/zc4NuIvIDX\nLeaderboard: https://t.co/zbTr3JPcCe https://t.co/kCkYf3fcNf"},{"created_at":"2024-06-18T14:28:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1803072300834541809"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"hf.co/blog/leaderboa…","end":83,"expanded_url":"https://hf.co/blog/leaderboard-bigcodebench","start":60,"url":"https://t.co/dRo1vRBLPV"},{"display_url":"bigcode-bench.github.io","end":120,"expanded_url":"https://bigcode-bench.github.io/","start":97,"url":"https://t.co/oUm1EcpAjn"},{"display_url":"huggingface.co/spaces/bigcode…","end":161,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/bigcode/bigcodebench-leaderboard","start":138,"url":"https://t.co/zbTr3JOEMG"},{"display_url":"huggingface.co/datasets/bigco…","end":199,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/bigcode/bigcodebench","start":176,"url":"https://t.co/MNpQBJ2Mbk"},{"display_url":"github.com/bigcode-projec…","end":234,"expanded_url":"https://github.com/bigcode-project/bigcodebench","start":211,"url":"https://t.co/wJF09Yi3H2"},{"display_url":"github.com/bigcode-bench/…","end":269,"expanded_url":"https://github.com/bigcode-bench/bigcode-bench.github.io/blob/main/paper.pdf","start":246,"url":"https://t.co/PeWXIZU84v"}]},"id":"1803072300834541809","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":2106,"like_count":23,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1803072298703851879","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"We release leaderboard, dataset, code, and paper:\n- 🤓 Blog: https://t.co/dRo1vRBLPV\n- 🌐 Website: https://t.co/oUm1EcpAjn\n- 🏆 Leaderboard: https://t.co/zbTr3JOEMG\n-  📚 Dataset: https://t.co/MNpQBJ2Mbk\n- 🛠️ Code: https://t.co/wJF09Yi3H2\n- 📄 Paper: https://t.co/PeWXIZU84v"},{"created_at":"2024-06-18T14:28:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1803072298703851879"],"id":"1803072298703851879","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2067,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1803072295910494686","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"BigCodeBench contains 1,140 function-level tasks to challenge LLMs to follow instructions and compose multiple function calls as tools from 139 Python libraries. To evaluate LLMs rigorously, each programming task encompasses 5.6 test cases with an average branch coverage of 99%."},{"created_at":"2024-06-18T14:28:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1803072295910494686"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/9fGrWJ6BtX","end":267,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BigCodeProject/status/1803072295910494686/photo/1","media_key":"16_1803071134985859073","start":244,"url":"https://t.co/9fGrWJ6BtX"}]},"id":"1803072295910494686","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":80,"impression_count":102343,"like_count":208,"quote_count":15,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":61},"text":"Introducing 🌸BigCodeBench: Benchmarking Large Language Models on Solving Practical and Challenging Programming Tasks!\n\nBigCodeBench goes beyond simple evals like HumanEval and MBPP and tests LLMs on more realistic and challenging coding tasks. https://t.co/9fGrWJ6BtX"},{"created_at":"2024-04-29T19:39:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1785031143907119531"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"huggingface.co/bigcode/starco…","end":105,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/bigcode/starcoder2-15b-instruct-v0.1","start":82,"status":200,"unwound_url":"https://huggingface.co/bigcode/starcoder2-15b-instruct-v0.1","url":"https://t.co/dnozmlCiyw"},{"display_url":"github.com/bigcode-projec…","end":137,"expanded_url":"https://github.com/bigcode-project/starcoder2-self-align","start":114,"status":200,"unwound_url":"https://github.com/bigcode-project/selfcodealign","url":"https://t.co/sam5YvHuG2"},{"display_url":"huggingface.co/datasets/bigco…","end":171,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/bigcode/self-oss-instruct-sc2-exec-filter-50k/","start":148,"status":200,"unwound_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/bigcode/self-oss-instruct-sc2-exec-filter-50k","url":"https://t.co/5a9BLnKRX0"}]},"id":"1785031143907119531","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":1467,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":2},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1785030523007439015","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"We release all the code, datasets, and models with a permissive license:\n\n🤖Model: https://t.co/dnozmlCiyw\n⚙️Code: https://t.co/sam5YvHuG2\n📚Dataset: https://t.co/5a9BLnKRX0"},{"created_at":"2024-04-29T19:36:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1785030523007439015"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"huggingface.co/blog/sc2-instr…","end":279,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/blog/sc2-instruct","start":256,"url":"https://t.co/V8lPrKVZNf"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Nas4A28GHP","end":303,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BigCodeProject/status/1785030523007439015/photo/1","media_key":"3_1785030280400515072","start":280,"url":"https://t.co/Nas4A28GHP"}]},"id":"1785030523007439015","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":120,"impression_count":38713,"like_count":281,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":73},"text":"Releasing StarCoder2 Instruct! 🚀 \n\nAchieves 72% HumanEval score using only self-generated content without any GPT-3.5/4 data. This work demonstrates that self-instruct works already well at the 15B scale without data from proprietary models!  \n\nRead more: https://t.co/V8lPrKVZNf https://t.co/Nas4A28GHP"},{"created_at":"2024-02-28T14:17:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1762844362495471879"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"drive.google.com/file/d/17iGn3c…","end":42,"expanded_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17iGn3c-sYNiLyRSY-A85QOzgzGnGiVI3/view?usp=sharing","start":19,"status":200,"unwound_url":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/17iGn3c-sYNiLyRSY-A85QOzgzGnGiVI3/view?usp=sharing","url":"https://t.co/zAf7ZTTfdA"}]},"id":"1762844362495471879","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":694,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1762842314341306525","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"Fixed report link: https://t.co/zAf7ZTTfdA"},{"created_at":"2024-02-28T14:08:55.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1762842317260554301"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":90,"id":"755877821671702528","start":74,"username":"ServiceNowRSRCH"},{"end":104,"id":"778764142412984320","start":92,"username":"huggingface"},{"end":116,"id":"61559439","start":109,"username":"nvidia"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"huggingface.co/datasets/bigco…","end":277,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/bigcode/the-stack-v2","start":254,"url":"https://t.co/XDXyN01jOv"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/FSyoMYzg15","end":301,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BigCodeProject/status/1762842317260554301/photo/1","media_key":"3_1762838800126861312","start":278,"url":"https://t.co/FSyoMYzg15"}]},"id":"1762842317260554301","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4906,"like_count":35,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":4},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1762842314341306525","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"This is the result of hard work by the BigCode community and supported by @ServiceNowRSRCH, @huggingface and @nvidia to train the 3B, 7B and 15B models!\n\nThe Stack v2 was built with @SoftwareHeritage and the full processed training data is coming soon!\n\nhttps://t.co/XDXyN01jOv https://t.co/FSyoMYzg15"},{"created_at":"2024-02-28T14:08:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1762842314341306525"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"hf.co/bigcode/report","end":270,"expanded_url":"http://hf.co/bigcode/report","start":247,"url":"https://t.co/AtSUepo0TQ"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/ZXLoJebrCZ","end":294,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BigCodeProject/status/1762842314341306525/photo/1","media_key":"3_1762816210234753024","start":271,"url":"https://t.co/ZXLoJebrCZ"}]},"id":"1762842314341306525","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":4599,"like_count":51,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":3},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1762842312005026258","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"StarCoder2 performs well on a wide range of coding and math tasks. The 15B model is best in its class, while the 3B model is at the performance of StarCoder1-15B.\n\nThis makes StarCoder2 models more efficient and performant!\n\nRead the full report: https://t.co/AtSUepo0TQ https://t.co/ZXLoJebrCZ"},{"created_at":"2024-02-28T14:08:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1762842312005026258"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"hf.co/bigcode/starco…","end":275,"expanded_url":"http://hf.co/bigcode/starcoder2-15b","start":252,"url":"https://t.co/fM7GinxJBd"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/NUeRjHEa05","end":299,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BigCodeProject/status/1762842312005026258/photo/1","media_key":"3_1762816018219429888","start":276,"url":"https://t.co/NUeRjHEa05"}]},"id":"1762842312005026258","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":241,"impression_count":223311,"like_count":659,"quote_count":46,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":202},"text":"Introducing: StarCoder2 and The Stack v2 ⭐️\n\nStarCoder2 is trained with a 16k token context and repo-level information for 4T+ tokens. All built on The Stack v2 - the largest code dataset with 900B+ tokens. \n\nAll code, data and models are fully open!\n\nhttps://t.co/fM7GinxJBd https://t.co/NUeRjHEa05"},{"created_at":"2023-11-06T17:52:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1721586270713884872"],"id":"1721586270713884872","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1010,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1721583097580249254","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"Make sure to opt-out within the next two weeks, we set the cut-off date on the November 20th."},{"created_at":"2023-11-06T17:39:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1721583097580249254"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"This tool checks if your GitHub repositories are included in The Stack dataset. Enter your GitHub username and select the dataset version to see if your code is part of it. If found, you can follow...","display_url":"huggingface.co/spaces/bigcode…","end":265,"expanded_url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/bigcode/in-the-stack","images":[{"height":648,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2081154137438199808/yBazIJ6r?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1200},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2081154137438199808/yBazIJ6r?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":242,"status":200,"title":"Am I in The Stack? - a Hugging Face Space by bigcode","unwound_url":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/bigcode/in-the-stack","url":"https://t.co/sLKdt0nLnP"}]},"id":"1721583097580249254","lang":"en","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":13644,"like_count":90,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":24},"text":"Exciting times: we are working on the next generation of StarCoder trained on a new dataset! 🚀\n\nIf you would like to have your code excluded from the training run you can check if your  data is in the dataset and follow the link to opt-out:\n\nhttps://t.co/sLKdt0nLnP"}],"meta":{"newest_id":"1975971062778327284","oldest_id":"1721583097580249254","result_count":18}}